00:10:18.684 --> 00:10:19.828
The CLI

00:10:20.810 --> 00:10:23.149
lolly runs any tool from the terminal

00:10:23.242 --> 00:10:25.601
through the same engine and the same

00:10:25.661 --> 00:10:29.232
