00:10:37.257 --> 00:10:39.943
url=x.

00:10:40.712 --> 00:10:43.380
That makes it the build-pipeline, CI and

00:10:43.441 --> 00:10:47.065
scripting surface: generate an OG card at

00:10:47.126 --> 00:10:51.800
